sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Load as Ingestion Layer
    participant Chunk as Chunker
    participant Embed as Embedder
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB
    participant RW as Query Rewriter
    participant LLM as Groq LLM
    participant Mem as Session Memory

    Note over U,Mem: Document Upload Flow
    U->>API: POST upload file
    API->>Load: load_document file
    Load-->>API: raw Documents plus metadata
    API->>Chunk: chunk_documents docs
    Chunk-->>API: chunked Documents
    API->>Embed: embed chunks
    Embed->>Chroma: add_documents chunks
    Chroma-->>API: chunks indexed
    API-->>U: chunks_indexed status

    Note over U,Mem: Conversational Query Flow
    U->>API: POST chat question session_id
    API->>Mem: get_history session_id
    Mem-->>API: recent turns
    API->>RW: rewrite_query question history
    RW->>LLM: rewrite prompt
    LLM-->>RW: standalone question
    RW-->>API: rewritten query
    API->>Chroma: similarity_search rewritten query
    Chroma-->>API: top-k relevant chunks
    API->>LLM: generate answer original question plus context plus history
    LLM-->>API: grounded answer
    API->>Mem: add_turn question answer
    API-->>U: answer sources rewritten_query